OL,3,A'Ship buster' missiles sink old US
OL,4,Awarship in live fire training off
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FA decommissioned US warship has been
OL,8,Fsunk off Scotland's west coast during a
OL,9,Ftraining exercise.
OL,11,FUSS Klakring was hit by a missile and a
OL,12,Ftorpedo before sinking in the North
OL,13,FAtlantic about 170 miles (274km) off
OL,14,Fthe Outer Hebrides last Monday.
OL,16,FThe US Navy said the ship went a
OL,17,Fthrough "rigorous" cleaning process
OL,18,Ffirst, and personnel checked for the
OL,19,Fpresence of whales and dolphins before
OL,20,Fthe live-firing exercise started.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
