OL,3,A'Ship buster' missiles sink old US
OL,4,Awarship in live fire training off
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FOther warships, including an aircraft
OL,8,Fcarrier in 2006, have been deliberately
OL,9,Fsunk at sea by the US as part of
OL,10,Ftraining and to create artificial reefs
OL,11,Ffor marine life.
